## Input

```vue
<template>
	<template v-for="item in items">
		<div :key="item.id">{{ item.name }}</div>
	</template>
	<component v-for="(item, index) in items" :is="item.component" :key="index" />
	<div v-if="enabled" v-for="item in items" :key="item.id">{{ item.name }}</div>
</template>

